WEBVTT

00:00:06.550 --> 00:00:09.570
Not only did he lose a Duel against Yuma Tsukumo...

00:00:09.570 --> 00:00:12.390
He gets ambushed and ends up in this sad state...

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:14.990
How pathetic.

00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:18.490
<i>I've been had...</i>

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:19.950
<i>B-By who?!</i>

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:22.560
<i>Shin...getsu.</i>

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:32.430
So there's just one Barian's Sphere Cube remaining, right?

00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:38.450
I'll fight to avenge Alit. I'll be the one to fight!

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:42.790
Don't let your emotions loose sight of our purpose.

00:00:42.790 --> 00:00:46.070
Our sole purpose is collecting the Numbers at all costs.

00:00:46.950 --> 00:00:48.590
I'm aware of that.

00:00:49.290 --> 00:00:53.850
Don't tell me you're going to use <i>that</i> Number?

00:00:57.070 --> 00:00:58.160
Very well.

00:00:58.730 --> 00:01:02.120
If you're prepared to go that far, I will leave it to you.

00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:06.390
In the meantime, I'll be taking Alit back to Barian.

00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:14.930
Just you watch, Alit. I'll definitely...

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:19.430
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:25.400
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:28.110
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:40.460
<i>Preparations for the fight are ready</i>

00:01:40.460 --> 00:01:43.540
<i>I can already hear the shivering of my heart</i>

00:01:43.710 --> 00:01:48.050
<i>Been waiting this whole time</i>

00:01:48.050 --> 00:01:50.420
<i>I may meet with defeat...</i>

00:01:50.630 --> 00:01:53.640
<i>But that's exactly why I have to stand back up</i>

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:58.180
<i>Need to get stronger again</i>

00:01:58.350 --> 00:02:00.310
<i>It's good to believe</i>

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:03.020
<i>The "now", more than ever before, is</i>

00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:05.480
<i>but another limit to break down</i>

00:02:05.480 --> 00:02:08.530
<i>I can cross with ease</i>

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:10.990
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:02:10.990 --> 00:02:17.030
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:19.790
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:02:19.830 --> 00:02:21.250
<i>Right here in my hand,</i>

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:25.960
<i>I'm holding a powerful trump card.</i>

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:35.010
<i>With an unbreakable heart, I face toward my dream!</i>

00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:54.110
Why do I gotta be chased by dogs first thing in the morning?!

00:02:54.280 --> 00:02:56.770
And besides that, you keep doing unnecessary things!

00:02:54.990 --> 00:02:59.700
"Gilag's Brutal Assault! Explode Forth,
Bukotsu the Pressure Point-Striking Delinquent"

00:02:56.770 --> 00:02:59.710
I just thought it would be for the best if we took a shortcut!

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:05.160
Did they just multiply!?

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:08.390
Give me a break already!

00:03:12.970 --> 00:03:14.650
Are you two okay?!

00:03:14.760 --> 00:03:16.710
Y-Yeah! No prob, no prob.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:18.760
Ouch, it hurts!

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:22.430
Man, all that trouble and you're still late.

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:25.390
I would have done those dogs in with one scratch, meow!

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:27.330
I'm sorry, Yuma-<i>kun</i>.

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:28.690
I just thought it was for the best.

00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:33.170
And to summarize, your ideas never wield good results.

00:03:33.170 --> 00:03:35.710
They all have flip sides, or not.

00:03:35.710 --> 00:03:36.860
Sorry...

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:40.210
Don't worry 'bout it!

00:03:40.210 --> 00:03:42.030
We got the perfect thrill today!

00:03:43.110 --> 00:03:44.160
Yuma-<i>kun</i>...!

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:46.990
So Yuma enjoyed the whole thing in the end, or not?

00:03:46.990 --> 00:03:50.120
To summarize, those two make a good fit.

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:59.190
Hey, Yuma, I haven't seen Astral today...

00:03:59.190 --> 00:04:00.340
Ah, yeah.

00:04:01.810 --> 00:04:04.250
The field we've been fighting in against Misael and Alit...

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:07.510
It seems like his body took damage from that.

00:04:10.630 --> 00:04:13.910
He's gotta really rest up inside the key.

00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:15.860
Yuma Tsukumo!

00:04:21.910 --> 00:04:23.120
You're...

00:04:24.100 --> 00:04:25.080
Gilag!

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:32.920
Watch out, Yuma.
 He may be up to something again.

00:04:34.650 --> 00:04:35.870
Astral...!

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:41.090
Yuma Tsukumo, Duel me!

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:42.550
Duel...?

00:04:42.550 --> 00:04:45.020
I'll be taking all of your Numbers.

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:47.760
Just calm down.

00:04:47.770 --> 00:04:50.360
I'll be waiting there tomorrow evening.

00:04:51.070 --> 00:04:54.310
We're having a head-to-head battle.
 Bring that Shingetsu with you.

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:55.310
Shingetsu?

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:56.730
Why?

00:04:57.810 --> 00:05:00.270
So I can crush the both of you.

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:03.450
Wait! Why do you need Shingetsu...?

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:08.610
You guys don't seem to know his true colors, do you?

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:11.160
That guy ambushed Alit.

00:05:11.590 --> 00:05:13.080
Shingetsu did that to Alit...?

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:16.280
That coward isn't getting away with it.

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:19.710
Just wait a minute! Shingetsu would never...!

00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:23.300
There's no way he would sneak up on Alit like that...!

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:25.260
What makes you so sure about that?!

00:05:25.730 --> 00:05:26.880
Well...

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:28.560
Well, <i>what</i>?!

00:05:29.340 --> 00:05:32.360
Well... Well...

00:05:33.190 --> 00:05:36.360
That's because... he's a wimp!

00:05:36.360 --> 00:05:41.030
...a wimp!

00:05:41.050 --> 00:05:44.320
I wonder if that was meant for a follow-up joke...

00:05:44.850 --> 00:05:46.680
That was really mean...

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:52.080
Then that's the story he forced you to swallow.
 Go ask him yourself!

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:02.290
What are you thinking so hard over?

00:06:03.570 --> 00:06:04.550
Well...

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:08.910
Alit is a Barian, but I can't bring myself to hate him.

00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:12.350
And Shingetsu ambushing Alit...

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:16.510
I don't think he could do something the like...

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:20.140
But I'm afraid to ask Shingetsu.

00:06:20.170 --> 00:06:21.570
Oh man...!

00:06:21.970 --> 00:06:24.530
Jumping in first before stressing over it.

00:06:24.530 --> 00:06:26.320
Isn't that how you usually are?

00:06:27.620 --> 00:06:29.450
Those are your lines, right?

00:06:30.910 --> 00:06:33.190
Bring it to 'im, Yuma.

00:06:37.510 --> 00:06:38.960
Shingetsu!

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:41.990
Good morning, Yuma-<i>kun</i>!

00:06:42.140 --> 00:06:42.940
Um, you know...

00:06:42.990 --> 00:06:47.300
Guess what? I found us the shortest possible route to school!

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:50.150
No, there's, um, something I want to ask...

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:53.340
- No worries! I thought it'd be 
for the best if I tried the route out myself!

00:06:53.610 --> 00:06:55.880
Yuma-<i>kun</i>, trust me!

00:06:57.760 --> 00:06:58.820
It'll be okay!

00:07:01.770 --> 00:07:03.060
You're right.

00:07:05.260 --> 00:07:07.650
Of course I trust you!

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:08.780
Yeah!

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:11.370
So what is it this time? We'll be going this way?

00:07:11.370 --> 00:07:12.240
Yes!

00:07:15.710 --> 00:07:17.880
Testuo-<i>kun</i>! Did you find him?

00:07:18.030 --> 00:07:19.190
No, he's not here.

00:07:20.370 --> 00:07:21.530
What's the matter?

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:23.910
Shingetsu-<i>kun</i>, have you seen Yuma?

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:26.420
Yuma-<i>kun</i> already went home.

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:28.590
He said he had somewhere to be...

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:30.360
So he went by himself after all.

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:31.490
Tetsuo-<i>kun</i>...!

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:34.190
Did something happen to Yuma?

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:36.450
Oh, nothing at all!

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:38.310
Alright, see you tomorrow!

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:46.140
Are you really all right with this, Yuma?

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:49.650
Yeah. I trust Shingetsu!

00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:53.650
So Yuma did keep it a secret from Shingetsu-<i>kun</i>, huh?

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:54.560
Yeah.

00:07:56.670 --> 00:07:59.880
He didn't tell us anything either.

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:02.210
He planned to burden the Duel alone...

00:08:20.150 --> 00:08:22.590
Yuma Tsukumo, Astral.

00:08:23.590 --> 00:08:25.450
Where's Shingetsu?!

00:08:26.170 --> 00:08:29.190
Shingetsu's not coming! Duel with me!

00:08:29.830 --> 00:08:33.050
His opponent wanted me to go to the Duel with him?

00:08:33.190 --> 00:08:34.050
Yeah...

00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:37.220
Yuma-<i>kun</i>, why didn't you say anything...?

00:08:37.730 --> 00:08:41.080
Yuma just didn't want to involve you, Shingetsu-<i>kun</i>.

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:44.290
Where's the Duel taking place?

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:46.760
What're you gonna do if we tell you?

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:49.010
Isn't it obvious? I have to go!

00:08:49.010 --> 00:08:51.270
Wait! Even if you go...!

00:08:51.270 --> 00:08:52.310
I know.

00:08:53.210 --> 00:08:56.810
Certainly, I'm terrible at Dueling, and I'm a cowardly mess.

00:08:57.410 --> 00:08:58.560
Shingetsu-<i>kun</i>...

00:08:59.360 --> 00:09:02.910
But... despite that, I wish he told me.

00:09:03.440 --> 00:09:06.940
I see Yuma-<i>kun</i> as my friend...

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:11.710
That's why I want Yuma-<i>kun</i> to see me as a friend, too.

00:09:13.950 --> 00:09:15.360
I got it, Shingetsu-<i>kun</i>.

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:19.370
Let's go to where Yuma is.

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:21.120
Hey, Kotori...!

00:09:22.280 --> 00:09:23.590
Kotori-<i>san</i>!

00:09:25.030 --> 00:09:27.560
What do you mean Shingetsu isn't coming?!

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:29.410
Shut it!

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:31.250
If I say he isn't coming, he isn't coming!

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:34.130
Besides, you're aiming for my Numbers, right?

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:35.790
Yeah, that's right!

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:40.310
But all the more, I want to beat that coward to shreds!

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:43.160
I'm telling you he didn't do it!

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:48.340
Fine, then I'll shred <i>you</i> first
 before going after Shingetsu!

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:51.030
He'll get crushed afterwards!

00:09:51.350 --> 00:09:52.940
Please wait!

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:58.590
Shingetsu?!

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:00.390
Why are you here?

00:10:00.550 --> 00:10:02.870
This isn't just some Duel!

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:05.850
He told you to bring me along, right?

00:10:06.190 --> 00:10:07.330
Well...

00:10:07.730 --> 00:10:09.960
So you can't trust me?

00:10:10.590 --> 00:10:12.730
Is it because you don't need me?

00:10:12.730 --> 00:10:14.300
That's not it!

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:18.220
I know I can't Duel well, but I'll give it my best shot!

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:19.590
Don't leave me out!

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:22.510
Sorry.

00:10:24.150 --> 00:10:25.270
Alright, I got it.

00:10:25.510 --> 00:10:27.730
Let's tackle this together!

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:33.930
But don't get totally reckless.
 I'll protect you, okay?

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:34.450
Yeah!

00:10:35.050 --> 00:10:36.510
Enough already!

00:10:36.910 --> 00:10:39.620
You guys shouldn't think you're getting off safely!

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:43.480
Barian's Sphere Field, expand!

00:10:56.750 --> 00:10:57.510
This is...!

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:13.900
Shingetsu, how dare you ambush Alit!

00:11:14.510 --> 00:11:17.340
I'll tear you into pieces in this field!

00:11:18.090 --> 00:11:21.080
What are you talking about? I did what..?

00:11:21.160 --> 00:11:23.790
Alit said you're the one who did it!

00:11:24.390 --> 00:11:26.040
That's more than enough!

00:11:26.310 --> 00:11:28.110
Then it's the same for me!

00:11:28.250 --> 00:11:28.960
<i>What</i>?!

00:11:29.220 --> 00:11:30.760
I believe in Shingetsu!

00:11:31.110 --> 00:11:31.910
Yuma-<i>kun</i>.

00:11:32.390 --> 00:11:33.710
Calm down, Yuma.

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:36.300
His wrath right now is much more...

00:11:39.480 --> 00:11:42.170
Astral! Are you okay? Hey!

00:11:42.360 --> 00:11:46.710
I..I'm fine. So it really is an effect of this field...

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:50.160
It's better you stay inside the Emperor's Key...

00:11:52.110 --> 00:11:54.270
His Dueling is still unexperienced.

00:11:54.890 --> 00:11:57.880
Fighting together could mean the worst for you...

00:11:58.920 --> 00:12:01.020
Right now, you still need me.

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:03.200
Yuma, we're winning this.

00:12:05.480 --> 00:12:06.420
I got it.

00:12:07.260 --> 00:12:08.480
Let's go, Shingetsu!

00:12:10.210 --> 00:12:12.250
Duel Disk, set!

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:18.840
D-Gazer, set!

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:30.050
Barial Force!

00:12:47.190 --> 00:12:49.450
So that's the guy's real form!?

00:12:53.610 --> 00:12:55.750
Now let's cut loose!

00:12:59.540 --> 00:13:00.360
Duel!!

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:04.430
This Duel will be played by Battle Royale Rules,

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:09.110
so until all three of us finish our first turns, nobody can attack.

00:13:10.160 --> 00:13:11.850
I take the first turn.

00:13:13.280 --> 00:13:14.360
Draw!

00:13:16.880 --> 00:13:19.420
I Summon Fire Hand!

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:28.680
Come forth, Fire Hand!

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:38.000
I'll be beating you with everything I've got!

00:13:38.530 --> 00:13:42.590
I'll burn you down to your bones!

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:48.910
He attached the Monster to himself?!

00:13:49.450 --> 00:13:52.140
Even though he isn't attacking, and we can feel its force!

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:53.890
What is this guy...?

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:57.360
I set one card and end my turn!

00:13:59.310 --> 00:14:01.560
Yuma-<i>kun</i>, I'll go next!

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:02.960
Oh... yeah.

00:14:03.420 --> 00:14:05.680
My turn! Draw.

00:14:06.310 --> 00:14:08.970
I'll definitely help Yuma-<i>kun</i> out!

00:14:09.050 --> 00:14:10.550
First I'll set up a defense!

00:14:10.550 --> 00:14:12.750
I Summon Shining Bomber!

00:14:22.140 --> 00:14:23.880
That idiot!

00:14:23.970 --> 00:14:25.430
Zero Attack Points?

00:14:25.560 --> 00:14:28.890
Oh no, I put him in Attack Position!

00:14:28.890 --> 00:14:30.730
This guy's a howler!

00:14:30.880 --> 00:14:36.080
He put a Monster with zero Attack Points in Attack Position so he can go on the <i>defensive</i>?

00:14:36.220 --> 00:14:37.930
Yuma-<i>kun</i>, I'm so sorry.

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:40.050
I... it's fine! Don't worry.

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:43.190
Yuma! That was as basic as you can get!

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:44.620
If he makes more mistakes like that...

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:47.080
Everybody makes mistakes! Even me!

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:48.970
Yuma-<i>kun</i>...

00:14:48.970 --> 00:14:50.680
Don't worry about it, I said.

00:14:50.850 --> 00:14:53.370
If you mess up, you gotta bring it to 'em, Shingetsu!

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:54.790
O... okay!

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:58.680
Yuma, it's a Barian we're up against right now!

00:14:59.540 --> 00:15:02.110
That mistake will burn us later for sure!

00:15:02.940 --> 00:15:05.880
I know. That's why I'll protect him!

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:09.540
Shingetsu jumped into this dangerous Duel alongside me.

00:15:11.170 --> 00:15:13.910
I set one card and end my turn!

00:15:14.520 --> 00:15:17.910
Let's go! It's my turn. Draw!

00:15:18.510 --> 00:15:21.140
I Special Summon Dododo Buster!

00:15:24.730 --> 00:15:27.610
When there are no other Monsters on my field,

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:30.760
I can lower the level of this card by two and Special Summon it!

00:15:31.220 --> 00:15:35.390
Wait! The Barian is after our Numbers! We have to strengthen our defense!

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:38.650
If we do that, Shingetsu's going to get attacked.

00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:42.390
But I won't leave Shingetsu unprotected!

00:15:43.410 --> 00:15:44.450
Yuma...

00:15:46.590 --> 00:15:47.840
Astral!

00:15:48.560 --> 00:15:52.050
Somehow it seems to be really painful.
It looks like he's sick.

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:55.450
Then I Summon Ganbara Knight!

00:16:00.220 --> 00:16:02.310
There are two Level Four Monsters!

00:16:03.590 --> 00:16:07.940
I Overlay the Level Four Dododo Buster and Ganbara Knight!

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:12.310
With these two Monsters, I build the Overlay Network!

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:14.280
Xyz Summon!

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:21.080
Come forth, Number 39! Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:16:25.160 --> 00:16:27.110
I'm counting on you, Hope.

00:16:28.140 --> 00:16:30.880
I set one card and end my turn!

00:16:33.270 --> 00:16:35.350
Summoning a Number right away?

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:39.220
My Turn. Draw!

00:16:41.320 --> 00:16:43.850
I summon Ice Hand!

00:17:00.270 --> 00:17:02.390
The Monster is attaching to him again...?

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:10.480
I Overlay the Level Four Fire Hand and Ice Hand.

00:17:16.480 --> 00:17:20.480
With these two Monsters, I build the Overlay Network!

00:17:20.790 --> 00:17:22.560
Xyz Summon!

00:17:30.050 --> 00:17:34.480
Smother this entire world! Number 106!

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:49.480
The Gigantic Palm of Stone, Giant Hand!

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:56.820
It's here, the Over Hundred Numbers.

00:17:57.950 --> 00:18:02.340
Shingetsu, you coward! I'll be taking revenge on you for Alit!

00:18:04.050 --> 00:18:05.960
Go, Giant Hand!

00:18:06.880 --> 00:18:09.390
Crush Shining Bomber!

00:18:12.850 --> 00:18:14.390
Hope's effect activates!

00:18:14.790 --> 00:18:18.880
By detaching one Overlay Unit, I can negate one opponent's attack!

00:18:19.140 --> 00:18:21.050
Moon Barrier!

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:24.390
Ha! I activate Giant Hand's effect.

00:18:24.680 --> 00:18:27.020
When an opponent's Monster effect is activated,

00:18:27.220 --> 00:18:31.250
by detaching one Overlay Unit, I can negate that effect!

00:18:31.990 --> 00:18:34.250
Hope's effect is negated!

00:18:36.280 --> 00:18:37.390
Take this!

00:18:38.020 --> 00:18:42.060
Monsters' Fatally Paralyzing Pressure Point Strike!

00:18:47.950 --> 00:18:50.050
He sealed away Hope's effect!

00:18:51.410 --> 00:18:57.620
Furthermore, so long as Giant Hand is on the field,
you can't use Hope's effect.

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:01.790
But Hope's Attack Power is still higher!

00:19:02.170 --> 00:19:06.710
If you think so, try and attack! It'll be your last time.

00:19:06.850 --> 00:19:08.000
What'd you say?

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:09.460
What does he mean by that?

00:19:09.460 --> 00:19:11.620
You'll find out when you try.

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:16.310
But what comes first is beating that coward senseless!

00:19:16.560 --> 00:19:21.340
Now Giant Hand, destroy Shining Bomber!

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:36.710
Shingetsu!

00:19:36.930 --> 00:19:41.940
I-I'm okay. I'm not going to be done in just like that.

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:45.020
Shining Bomber's effect activates!

00:19:45.510 --> 00:19:50.190
When this Monster is destroyed
 600 points of damage are inflicted to the opponent!

00:19:52.140 --> 00:19:55.020
I activate the Trap Card, Refuse Hand!

00:19:56.330 --> 00:20:01.260
If there is a Monster with the word ‘Hand' on my field when this card is activated,

00:20:01.420 --> 00:20:04.220
it negates Effect Damage inflicted on me!

00:20:05.820 --> 00:20:09.650
You don't really get your own Monster's effect, do you?

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:12.480
When Shining Bomber gets destroyed,

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:16.850
600 Points of damage are inflicted to <i>all</i> players!

00:20:17.770 --> 00:20:20.190
E... every player?

00:20:21.510 --> 00:20:23.310
No... no way...

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:28.360
With Giant Hand on my side of the field, I take no damage.

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:31.650
What a shame!

00:20:31.650 --> 00:20:34.310
Even though you were so keen on activating that effect.

00:20:34.650 --> 00:20:37.250
<i>Upside daisy... Go!</i>

00:20:47.810 --> 00:20:48.760
Guys...!

00:20:48.790 --> 00:20:49.790
Come on...

00:20:50.190 --> 00:20:55.560
With that, both get the damage inflicted
and their opponent's not even scratched!

00:20:57.510 --> 00:20:59.360
Shingetsu, you alright?

00:20:59.630 --> 00:21:01.010
I'm so sorry...

00:21:01.010 --> 00:21:02.780
I just meant well, but...

00:21:03.020 --> 00:21:04.390
It can't be helped.

00:21:04.390 --> 00:21:06.070
Our opponent had the upper hand on us.

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:06.790
Yuma.

00:21:07.620 --> 00:21:08.290
Astral!

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:13.080
As I thought, trying to fight and protect him in this Duel...

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:14.130
...is dangerous.

00:21:14.450 --> 00:21:16.110
But... but...!

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:19.420
You can't expect me to leave Shingetsu behind!

00:21:20.170 --> 00:21:21.390
Yuma...

00:21:21.620 --> 00:21:25.340
It's not like I do not understand how you feel, but...

00:21:25.910 --> 00:21:27.800
No ifs, ands or buts!

00:21:28.250 --> 00:21:30.480
I'm not abandoning Shingetsu!

00:21:31.870 --> 00:21:33.390
At this rate...!

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:51.740
A...Astral?

00:21:52.480 --> 00:21:53.560
Astral!

00:21:54.910 --> 00:21:56.220
Hey, Astral?

00:21:57.030 --> 00:21:58.110
Astral?!

00:22:04.810 --> 00:22:07.180
Astral!!

00:22:17.270 --> 00:22:24.150
<i>Does the thought "In any case..." following</i>

00:22:24.560 --> 00:22:31.820
<i>the foreboding premonition tell you to give up?</i>

00:22:31.820 --> 00:22:39.410
<i>Do you laugh at your dreams, saying "impossible"?</i>

00:22:39.410 --> 00:22:46.750
<i>You must find it funny that I'm not able to laugh at it, right?</i>

00:22:47.340 --> 00:23:03.690
<i>This song supports me, so I'll do my best for you this time.
 It's my turn to sing now.</i>

00:23:03.690 --> 00:23:08.480
<i>I will vow to you here</i>

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:18.830
<i>As long as I live, you'll always be my tiny, little friend</i>

00:23:18.830 --> 00:23:27.380
<i>I'll erase all those little mistakes of yours</i>

00:23:27.380 --> 00:23:32.170
<i>Because I want to become an artist</i>

00:23:33.970 --> 00:23:38.470
<i>Look, I like doing it 'cuz it's fun.</i>

00:23:40.830 --> 00:23:43.310
We're up against Gilag's ferocious Over Hundred Number.

00:23:43.790 --> 00:23:46.940
Astral collapsed, and our remaining Life is...!

00:23:47.890 --> 00:23:51.420
But in this Duel, I'm definitely going to protect my friend!

00:23:51.430 --> 00:23:53.530
We can't fight this together. I'm sorry...

00:23:53.530 --> 00:23:54.080
Kotori!

00:23:54.270 --> 00:23:55.450
Take care of Astral!

00:23:55.480 --> 00:23:57.420
I believe in you, Yuma!

00:23:57.450 --> 00:23:59.740
I'm not abandoning anybody!

00:23:59.990 --> 00:24:02.110
Next on Yu-Gi-Oh! Zexal II!

00:24:02.220 --> 00:24:05.460
"The Pulse of V: The Super Rebirth: Hope Ray V!"

00:24:05.740 --> 00:24:09.340
This card... it's my new power!
